  "summary": "The sunlit counterpart of Dark Academia: airy libraries, cream and beige, gentle scholarship without the gothic dread.",
  "description": "Light Academia keeps the collegiate romance — books, Latin, campus greens — but bathes it in morning light: cream knits, beige trenches, honey wood, open curtains. It emerged ~2019-2020 as the optimistic sibling when dark academia boomed, trading melancholy for gentle nostalgia. Aesthetically it borrows Ivy prep, golden-hour campus photography and beige-era minimalism.",
